{"id":"613210988","kind":"article","title":"二次方募资在何种程度上可以资助思维工具的创作？","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2znyciwTKuthTj6cReuPpHX37odgwjvTZrWG"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2023-03-13","updated":"2026-10-28","votes":3,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":424,"keywords":["二次方募资","思想工具","公共物品","研究资助","用户界面"],"summary":"短文讨论能否用二次方募资支持思想工具的创作。作者认为，这种机制可能适用于项目投资和维持阶段，但担心人们难以评价早期研究，也担心研究者在募资前开展探索性工作的付出得不到补偿。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/613210988","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"W2Em_eUl\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5YhNc8HVKxjg9a3h3SeCyKqnNDFgiY6WGrM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">思想工具</a>很难募资，这很大程度上是因为<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zXseK39g1SHgQvMXLbnaB1AUZ2WL5ffDzsbZ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新颖的用户界面创意是公共物品</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。那么<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6d3zr35eY2KeyrBAXQbsZ8cTTyTCdxWaBmcC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">公共物品的二次方募资</a>是否可以解决这一问题？</p><p data-pid=\"06I7rvnj\">这种方法对于项目的投资和维持阶段来说似乎是很有前景的，但是我有几点担心之处：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"V6A2pmM0\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3rEZt3xPydnucv4Um8NTtRQY6P3uqTuvHso9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">人们通常不能可靠地评估早期研究</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"wo9xjsMV\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8EJnm4CKy2n2YKhByeZdv76D3vRHjsJL8WpV\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">二次方募资缺少在预案前工作方面对研究者的补偿</a> <br/> </li></ul><hr/><p data-pid=\"ZIuQ3OaY\">2020/09/09 此话题的推特风暴：<a class=\"external\" href=\"https://twitter.com/andy_matuschak/status/1303759634331701248\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"visible\">twitter.com/andy_matusc</span><span class=\"invisible\">hak/status/1303759634331701248</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"FfsiGJ1n\">暂无</li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"WqL_T9g6\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 <span class=\"nolink\">Lucas-Tsui</span>、校对 Shom<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2znyciwTKuthTj6cReuPpHX37odgwjvTZrWG\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">To what extent can quadratic funding provision tools for thought? (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 新颖的用户界面创意是公共物品 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"642001483\" href=\"#/post/642001483\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"613210805","title":"赞助人模式在何种程度上可以资助思想工具的创作？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"617153188","title":"电子阅读很难维持多个阅读位置","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":17,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"642001483","title":"新颖的用户界面创意是公共物品","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}